16940 PUT (8, 133), R28, XOR
16950 LINE (8, 155)-(105, 145), 3
16960 LINE (75, 175)-(120, 170), 3
16970 FOR IR70 = 1 TO 2
16980   SOUND 32676, 1
16990 NEXT
