17190 PALETTE 2, 11
17200 PALETTE 3, 3
17210 KEY OFF
17220 R76 = 0#
17230 FOR IR70 = 1 TO 35
17240   GOSUB 17070
17250   IF RND <= .8 THEN GOTO 17310
17260   COLOR 15
17270   R76 = 1 'PASS2-RECON: reset hold counter (was GoTo 17290 '????; Rem error 12 (1) hint = arg 1). R76 was clobbered by GOSUB 17070 above; resetting lets the white flash linger ~2 ticks so the lightning is visible.
17280   SOUND 32676, .04
17290   R76 = R76 + 1
17300   IF R76 <= 2 THEN GOTO 17280
17310   COLOR 0
